    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Enhancing everything players love about the freerunning nature of STRIDE, the full-fledged sequel 'Fates' pushes the parkour action formula even further with new story-oriented gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597880/extras/e0b39a6a52434ef6ed6bcb6c06f4c569.poster.avif?t=1723138398\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597880/extras/e0b39a6a52434ef6ed6bcb6c06f4c569.webm?t=1723138398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597880/extras/e0b39a6a52434ef6ed6bcb6c06f4c569.mp4?t=1723138398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEET YOUR FATE</h2><br>Raised in the slums of dystopian Airon City, at the very bottom of food chain, you got a golden ticket out.<br><br>To survive and climb the ladder in elite police forces of SkyChase, you will have to deal with power shifts in gangs, dirty family feuds, corporate secrets, forbidden tech and much more.<br><br>Your fate is bound with other motley characters in this story. Will you accept the destiny or fight against it?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597880/extras/d47ebbbd36aa14ba1d67464b31960208.poster.avif?t=1723138398\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597880/extras/d47ebbbd36aa14ba1d67464b31960208.webm?t=1723138398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597880/extras/d47ebbbd36aa14ba1d67464b31960208.mp4?t=1723138398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEEL LIKE A PARKOUR SPEC-OPS OFFICER</h2><br>\u25c9 Climb buildings, vault through windows, and slide down cables with lightning speed.<br>\u25c9 Explore major locations under the watch of snipers and drones.<br>\u25c9 Engage in tactical close-quarters combat.<br>\u25c9 Use your gadgets and hacking skills to outwit thugs and corporates.<br><br>From dirty slums to affluent skyscrapers, you will visit many places to enjoy the view and challenge your reflexes in action-packed gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597880/extras/63bf3663c67d8d4f485e047562a2d229.poster.avif?t=1723138398\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597880/extras/63bf3663c67d8d4f485e047562a2d229.webm?t=1723138398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597880/extras/63bf3663c67d8d4f485e047562a2d229.mp4?t=1723138398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TECHNOLOGICAL LEAP</h2><br>Reworked STRIDE Engine now offers advanced levels of graphics, physics and interactivity on PCVR. We refined every aspect of the original STRIDE: shooting and weapons, enemy variety and their AI\u2026 the list goes on and on.<br><br>When you run, fight, interact with characters or solve puzzles, you will feel a major leap in technology.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENTRY POINT INTO THE STRIDE UNIVERSE</h2><br>\u2018Fates\u2019 is a separate game that offers a smooth entry and deep gameplay mechanics to keep you hooked until the end-credits and beyond.<br><br>It is newcomer-friendly and doesn\u2019t require your skills or knowledge from the original game. STRIDE: Fates is a great fit for everyone from narrative lovers to fitness enthusiasts.<br><br>Are you ready to step into the shoes of a parkour spec-ops officer? <br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597880/extras/4e9b8ed09c9f99905abdc95a5bcea32f.webp?t=1723138398\" width=620 height=50 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Enhancing everything players love about the freerunning nature of STRIDE, the full-fledged sequel 'Fates' pushes the parkour action formula even further with new story-oriented gameplay.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597880/extras/e0b39a6a52434ef6ed6bcb6c06f4c569.poster.avif?t=1723138398\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597880/extras/e0b39a6a52434ef6ed6bcb6c06f4c569.webm?t=1723138398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597880/extras/e0b39a6a52434ef6ed6bcb6c06f4c569.mp4?t=1723138398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MEET YOUR FATE</h2><br>Raised in the slums of dystopian Airon City, at the very bottom of food chain, you got a golden ticket out.<br><br>To survive and climb the ladder in elite police forces of SkyChase, you will have to deal with power shifts in gangs, dirty family feuds, corporate secrets, forbidden tech and much more.<br><br>Your fate is bound with other motley characters in this story. Will you accept the destiny or fight against it?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597880/extras/d47ebbbd36aa14ba1d67464b31960208.poster.avif?t=1723138398\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597880/extras/d47ebbbd36aa14ba1d67464b31960208.webm?t=1723138398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2597880/extras/d47ebbbd36aa14ba1d67464b31960208.mp4?t=1723138398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEEL LIKE A PARKOUR SPEC-OPS OFFICER</h2><br>\u25c